52,"business_id":"lo3zYtvPB6-iVok2C7HsGw","nv_rank":276,"mm_rank":388,"nv_score":0.6538360118865967,"mm_score":0.5400599837303162,"rank_movement":-112,"has_visual_feature":true,"name":"Old New Orleans Rum","address":"2815 Frenchmen St","city":"New Orleans","state":"LA","postal_code":"70122","stars":4.5,"review_count":283,"categories":["Food","Tours","Distilleries","Hotels & Travel","Beer","Wine & Spirits","Breweries"],"is_open":true},"evidence":{"source":"frozen-model","summary":{"business_id":"lo3zYtvPB6-iVok2C7HsGw","user_id":"D76EFdD5F7XoIIyQmWTQhA","user_row":3279,"nv_rank":276,"mm_rank":388,"target_category_support_fraction":0.42857142857142855,"selected_image_count":5,"label_diversity":4,"target_visual_score_gain":null,"target_visual_rank_gain":null,"competitive_visual_rank_effect":null},"category_overlap":[{"category":"Food","historical_business_count":3},{"category":"Tours","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Distilleries","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Hotels & Travel","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Beer","historical_business_count":1},{"category":"Wine & Spirits","historical_business_count":1},{"category":"Breweries","historical_business_count":0}],"history":[{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Beer, Food, Wine & Spirits","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"lo3zYtvPB6-iVok2C7HsGw","review_id":"ji8h5C2jnFxjvMXSgLObRA","date":"2013-12-09T02:46:29","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9670668244361877,"text_excerpt":"We love rum. A lot. I booked this tour while still at home for 10$ a person...when we arrived to New Orleans there was some tourist literature in our hotel with a buy one get one half off coupon. No big deal- just pointing it out so that if you want to book while in New Orleans, check for the coupon. There is no transportation provided at the weekend.. the cab from the French Quarter to the distillery was about 10-12$. Some people told us to be careful in the district where the distillery is located- we felt safe and had no issues at all. When we arrived there were about 15 other people there mingling- we had welcome drinks of sweet (VERY sweet) tea with rum. The tour guide told us to fee..."},{"business_id":"lo3zYtvPB6-iVok2C7HsGw","review_id":"PbTiSAa1NCQPqYDmnYYUSg","date":"2011-12-13T14:10:29","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9605877995491028,"text_excerpt":"This was such a fun tour, and I'd definitely recommend it for anyone visiting New Orleans! The $10 admission includes free pickup from the French Quarter, making it really convenient for tourists who don't have a car. The guy who picked us up also happened to be the tour guide, and he was really friendly and funny. As soon as we got to the distillery, he mixed us all drinks. The cocktail that day involved lemonade and (of course) rum, and was sweeter than something I would normally drink, but refreshing on a hot day, and STRONG. Be careful with those cocktails! Once we all had our drinks, the tour started. It lasted about a half hour and covered everything from the history of the distille..."},{"business_id":"lo3zYtvPB6-iVok2C7HsGw","review_id":"JkFRLbrp5CxtgCd3uGl6gA","date":"2018-07-11T17:50:11","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9601095914840698,"text_excerpt":"My friends and I booked this tour during our recent stay in New Orleans. It was very fun! The shuttle picked up from the French Market to take to the distillery. Once there, you get a welcome cocktail (YAY!) and then a history of the distillery. This if followed by a tour and a tasting of all their rums (5 in total). And if your lucky, there is some left over cocktail and you can have one as you leave. It's a good experience for $15. The rums were actually very smooth and tasty...and I'm not a big rum drinker. I would recommend checking them out if you are looking for something different to do."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"lo3zYtvPB6-iVok2C7HsGw","photo_id":"q1XWd1PgQU4squz79g51yw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/q1XWd1PgQU4squz79g51yw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9000547528266907},{"business_id":"lo3zYtvPB6-iVok2C7HsGw","photo_id":"8dqhpVKzd9P-4ZdBA1xZGg","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/8dqhpVKzd9P-4ZdBA1xZGg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8865821361541748},{"business_id":"lo3zYtvPB6-iVok2C7HsGw","photo_id":"ujMFlfvF8OZ1OgHx-SpcWw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/ujMFlfvF8OZ1OgHx-SpcWw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8270717859268188},{"business_id":"lo3zYtvPB6-iVok2C7HsGw","photo_id":"7A1wKvAw0x050mShaxuYwA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/7A1wKvAw0x050mShaxuYwA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7911189198493958},{"business_id":"lo3zYtvPB6-iVok2C7HsGw","photo_id":"YdfEBwEgkrzzJyDy1k20VA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/YdfEBwEgkrzzJyDy1k20VA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7822580337524414}]},"notebook_case":null}
